    "description": "Enhance and maintain current code for a multi-threaded application used for designing and printing tags and labels, including Radio Frequency Identification (RFID), on various Avery Dennison printers using Visual C++ and XML.  \n\nPerform Unit and Functional testing on code enhancements.\n\nCreate Functional Specifications and Design Documents from Marketing Requirements Documentation.\n\nCreate test procedure documents and maintain code change documentation for each build release.\n\nDebug code utilizing a variety of programs including: \n Advanced Serial Port Monitor, Serial IP, and RS232 Analyzer to monitor and validate proper communication between printer and application.\nHxD Hex Editor to read unprintable characters that are used in the communication between printer and application.\nIBM Rational Purify Plus to diagnose any memory leaks in the program.\nWinDbg to allow stepping through the code to identify issues.",
